上瑶池绮席开。\n可但六宫环佩响，重孙满眼贺春来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":24307,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"立春帖子 其三 太上皇后阁","author":"周必大","text":"聚景贮壶春，仙关昼不扃。\n小桃无数发，好幸綵霞亭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":24308,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"立春帖子 其六 太上皇后阁","author":"周必大","text":"两宫勤俭妇承姑，铺翠销金举世无。\n茧馆新蚕家法在，民间应有裤兼襦。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":24309,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"立春帖子 其四 太上皇后阁","author":"周必大","text":"郁郁纷纷三素云，元君朝帝庆新春。\n琼楼玉女争迎拜，应许双成侍给轮。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":24310,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"立春帖子 其四 太上皇后阁","author":"周必大","text":"旧疑庄叟大椿年，一度春回岁八千。\n今见东皇与西母，谁言此语是虚传。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":24311,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"立春帖子 其三 太上皇后阁","author":"周必大","text":"彤管播徽音，年年姒佐文。\n向来长乐注，溢美谩纷纭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":24312,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"立春帖子 其二 太上皇后阁","author":"周必大","text":"白玉重镌册，黄金再铸章。\n宫中饶乐事，大典对春阳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":24313,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"立春帖子 其二 太上皇帝阁","author":"周必大","text":"溥博参洪造，希夷法自然。\n鸿名称盛礼，玉册趁新年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":24314,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"立春帖子 其五 太上皇帝阁","author":"周必大","text":"楼名聚远倚晴空，无限风光入坐中。\n岂是帝家移帝力，由来天子即天公。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":24315,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"立春帖子 其一 太上皇帝阁","author":"周必大","text":"溥博仁由性，诚明德乃真。\n岂能名荡荡，聊与万方春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":24316,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"立春帖子 其六 太上皇帝阁","author":"周必大","text":"湖上春光次第还，夹街新展集芳园。\n定知花木开偏早，惯识东皇造化恩。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":24317,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"立春帖子 其五 太上皇帝阁","author":"周必大","text":"官家阅武向茅篱，供帐都亭看凯还。\n凤辇过门亲献寿，春风先已满人间。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":24318,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"立春帖子 其四 太上皇帝阁","author":"周必大","text":"气冲鱼钥敞金扉，风射蛟冰泮玉池。\n从此苑中多乐事，和诗谁是沈佺期。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":24319,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"立春帖子 其二 太上皇帝阁","author":"周必大","text":"殿阁无为日，朝廷有道时。\n椒浮重酝酒，花发万年枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":24320,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"立春帖子 其三 太上皇帝阁","author":"周必大","text":"有道春偏好，无为日更舒。\n齐心大庭馆，何处觅华胥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":24321,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"立春帖子 其三 太上皇帝阁","author":"周必大","text":"俗阜登台乐，农祥击壤谣。\n何人知帝力，尔极听垂髫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":24322,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"立春帖子 其四 太上皇帝阁","author":"周必大","text":"青阳布治周三纪，黄屋非心正九年。\n圣子有为今出震，天公不宰旧乘乾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":24323,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"立春帖子 其三 太上皇帝阁","author":"周必大","text":"字缕黄金胜，酥□白玉盘。\n不须誇百巧，百□□□□。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":24324,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"立春帖子 其一 太上皇帝阁","author":"周必大","text":"瑞雪收残腊，和风报早春。\n祝尧千万寿，常与岁俱新。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79